condary);\">單選題</p></div>兩個體積相同、溫度相同的容器，A 裝 100 個理想氣體粒子，B 裝 200 個同種粒子。哪個敘述最合理？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_e9_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_e9_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 兩者壓力相同</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_eb_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\">",
